  "question": {
    "text": "The probability of getting sum more than 7 when a pair of dice are thrown is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "toHsi",
      "text": "$\\frac{7}{36}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Uz62z",
      "text": "$\\frac{5}{12}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HoWOd",
      "text": "$\\frac{7}{12}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SVtf1",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here $n(S)=6^2=36$<br />Let $\\mathrm{E}$ be the event \"getting sum more than 7\" i.e. sum of pair of dice $=8,9,10,11,12$<br />i.e. $E=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{lllll}(2,6) & (3,5) & (4,4) & (5,3) & (6,2) \\\\ (3,6) & (4,5) & (5,4) & (6,3) \\\\ (4,6) & (5,5) & (6,4) & \\\\ (5,6) & (6,5) & (6,6) & \\end{array}\\right\\}$<br />$\\therefore \\quad n(E)=15 . \\therefore$ Req. prob $=\\frac{n(E)}{n(S)}=\\frac{15}{36}=\\frac{5}{12}$",
    "image": null
  },
